# ==============================================================================
# APPLICATION WINDOW ICON
# ==============================================================================
# The project logo (blue panes-and-gear mark from freemixkit_icon.ico) as
# base64 ICO bytes, vendored so the built script stays self-contained: the
# window/taskbar icon works even when no sibling .ico file exists, which is
# the case for the `irm | iex` launch path that has no local directory.
#
# Same artwork as the root freemixkit_icon.ico, multi-size 16..256
# PNG-compressed entries with alpha preserved. Regenerate from the root
# .ico rather than editing by hand.
#
# This scalar intentionally does not match the $FmkLogos entry shape that
# Compile.ps1 validates, so no build-check change is needed.

$FmkAppIconB64 = ''
